==English==
[[File:Efeito dominó.gif|thumb|320px|upright|The domino effect.]]
[[File:Domino effect.jpg|thumb|200px|upright|Domino effect.]]

===Etymology===
An [[allusion]] to a row of dominoes in which the fall of one leads to a cascade of falling pieces

===Noun===
{{en-noun|?|sg=[[domino]] [[effect]]}}

# The situation in which one [[event]] sets off a [[chain]] of additional events.
# {{politics|historical}} The [[theory]] that, if [[South Vietnam]] fell to [[Communism]], it would be followed by [[Cambodia]], [[Laos]], and additional South Asian countries.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|theory of encroaching communism}} [[domino theory]]

